      "value": "<p>Your Hunter’s Mark manifests as an inexorable pull toward the deep. While a creature is marked by your Hunter’s Mark:</p><ul><li>Its Speed is reduced by 10 feet, and it cannot benefit from effects that increase its Speed.</li><li>If the marked creature willingly moves 10+ feet, it takes Cold damage equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1) once per turn.</li></ul><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.05184ac6d28b7b52]{Drowning Mark — Cold Damage}</li></ul>"
